ss=\"bracket-answer\">C</span>）。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. cháo</span>\n      <span>B. zhāo</span>\n      <span>C. zhī</span>\n      <span>D. shā</span>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"sub-question\" style=\"margin-top: 10px;\">\n      2. \"潮\"会意字，本义为涨潮，\"潮\"还有另外的含义，下列哪一项与\"潮\"的含义无关（<span class=\"bracket-answer\">B</span>）。\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"options\">\n      <span>A. 潮湿</span>\n      <span>B. 湿重</span>\n      <span>C. 寒重</span>\n      <span>D. 接近</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Question Two -->\n  <div class=\"question-section\">\n    <div class=\"question-label\">二、选择恰当的词语填入括号里。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"word-table\">\n      <table>\n        <tr>\n          <td>吹牛</td>\n          <td>起人</td>\n          <td>对号</td>\n          <td>反问</td>\n          <td>设问</td>\n        </tr>\n      </table>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"fill-sentence\">\n      1. 空手在花园里，吹着和煦的春风，呼吸着（<span class=\"handwritten\">拟人</span>）（<span class=\"handwritten\">比喻</span>）<br>\n      2. 面对这样美丽的句子，作者用怎样的语气来问，如何回答？（<span class=\"handwritten\">反问</span>）<br>\n      3. 怎么会有这样大的力量？这样美丽的<span class=\"long-underline\"></span>（<span class=\"handwritten\">反问</span>）<br>\n      4. 日出时阳光普照大地，春风吹拂大地如盘。（<span class=\"handwritten\">打比</span>）\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Poem Section -->\n  <div class=\"poem-section\">\n    <div class=\"poem-title\">读诗练笔</div>\n    <div class=\"poem-instruction\">四、写出下列诗句中描写事物的名称。</div>\n\n    <div class=\"poem-line\">\n      1. 日暮客愁新野旷天低树——写的是<span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"handwritten\">原野和树木</span></span>，表达诗人<span class=\"underline\"><span class=\"handwritten\">孤寂惆怅</span></span>的心情。<br>\n      2. 我们——爱——自己的一祖国——（<span class=\"handwritten\">热爱祖国</span>）<br>\n      3. 等——待——小从枝头探出脑袋来。（<span class=\"handwritten\">活泼可爱</span>）\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Cloud decoration placeholder -->\n  <svg class=\"cloud-decoration\" viewBox=\"0 0 100 60\" fill=\"#b0d4f1\">\n    <ellipse cx=\"30\" cy=\"40\" rx=\"25\" ry=\"